{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And if a goat.</b> Of the goat species, male or female, like the rule of the sheep. And among cattle he did not mention the fat tail, but only for the sheep, because the fat tail in goats and cattle is small, and also because the sheep that are in the land of Israel have a large fat tail — and this is a well-known matter."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:32.270632190Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}